      "content": "it just feels so futile though. like, what is \"hope\" actually supposed to fix? i'm just waiting for the next thing to die or leave. it feels like i'm just staying around to watch more things disappear. it would be so much more peaceful to just... not have to deal with the waiting anymore. wouldn't it?",
